[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; The plaza's benches, placed by hand. Editor-owned: move, turn, add or remove
; benches here in the Godot editor. Each is an instance of
; `park_furniture/plaza_bench.tscn`, whose seat markers tell the crowd where to
; sit, so `tools/gen_crowd.gd` reads this scene and seated guests follow any
; change after the crowd is regenerated. `tools/gen_props.gd` reads the
; `bench_hut` placement for the balloons tied to its back rail.
;
; Moved out of the generator on 2026-09-24 at the positions it last emitted.

